    "updated_at": "2021-07-14T06:49:55Z",
    "body": "I think last year @mystor mentioned something about the Firefox support for this in [this comment](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JtDCN9A_1UBlDuwkjn1HWxdhQ1H2un9K4kyPLgBqJUc/edit?pli=1&disco=AAAAJ051QQ4) but looks like there's some desire to follow Chrome here (not cache when the browsing context group contains > 1 top level pages). I think it's reasonable, and would be a good thing to add to the spec.",
