    "created_at": "2021-07-16T01:42:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-16T01:57:05Z",
    "body": "Thanks. I was mostly curious if you had some good remedy to the \"quite strange impacts\". So maybe we should be aiming to spec that we can't cache in this case.",
