    "created_at": "2021-08-13T03:43:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-13T03:43:35Z",
    "body": "I would expect that reports of strange impacts would be rare but unless there's a reasonable way to spec what's supposed to happen, I would like to spec that it must not happen (and test that).",
